
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
C3 · Resource change notifications: listen() (2026) vs subscribeResource() (2025)
SDK: client.listen, McpSubscription.honoredFilter / close / closed, client.subscribeResource, client.unsubscribeResource, client.setNotificationHandler('notifications/resources/updated'), handler.notify.resourceUpdated, server.sendResourceUpdated
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── 2026-07-28 — client.listen() against the real HTTP server (separate process) 

▶ Open a subscription stream for one student profile
  listen({"resourceSubscriptions":["academic://students/2201005"]})
  ✔ 6ms → 
    {
      "honoredFilter": {
        "resourceSubscriptions": [
          "academic://students/2201005"
        ]
      }
    }

▶ Another client changes a grade
  callTool update_grade({"student_id":"2201005"})
  ✔ 212ms → 
    {
      "toolResult": "Grade inserted: CS202 2032-1 → total 9 (A). Cumulative GPA 1 → 1.67.",
      "notificationsReceived": [
        {
          "uri": "academic://students/2201005",
          "gpaAfterReRead": 1.67
        }
      ]
    }

▶ subscription.close(), then change again → no notification
  close + callTool()
  ✔ 237ms → 
    {
      "toolResult": "Grade inserted: CS202 2032-2 → total 9 (A). Cumulative GPA 1.67 → 1.67.",
      "closedReason": "local",
      "newNotifications": 0
    }

── 2025 — client.subscribeResource() on a long-lived connection ──────────────

▶ Change a grade BEFORE subscribing → nothing arrives
  callTool update_grade()
  ✔ 209ms → 
    {
      "toolResult": "Grade inserted: CS202 2032-3 → total 9 (A). Cumulative GPA 1 → 1.67.",
      "notificationsReceived": 0
    }

▶ subscribeResource
  subscribeResource({"uri":"academic://students/2201005"})
  ✔ 2ms → {}

▶ Change a grade AFTER subscribing
  callTool update_grade()
  ✔ 214ms → 
    {
      "toolResult": "Grade inserted: CS202 2032-4 → total 9 (A). Cumulative GPA 1.67 → 1.67.",
      "notificationsReceived": [
        {
          "uri": "academic://students/2201005",
          "gpaAfterReRead": 1.67
        }
      ]
    }

▶ unsubscribeResource
  unsubscribeResource({"uri":"academic://students/2201005"})
  ✔ 1ms → {}

▶ Change a grade after unsubscribing → nothing new
  callTool update_grade()
  ✔ 213ms → 
    {
      "newNotifications": 0
    }

── Using the wrong API for the era ───────────────────────────────────────────

▶ listen() on a 2025 connection
  listen({"resourceSubscriptions":["academic://students/2201005"]})
  ✖ 1ms → SdkError (code METHOD_NOT_SUPPORTED_BY_PROTOCOL_VERSION): subscriptions/listen requires a 2026-07-28-era connection (negotiated: 2025-11-25). On a 2025-era connection, change notifications are delivered unsolicited: use ClientOptions.listChanged and resources/subscribe instead.

▶ subscribeResource() on a 2026 connection
  subscribeResource({"uri":"academic://students/2201005"})
  ✖ 0ms → SdkError (code METHOD_NOT_SUPPORTED_BY_PROTOCOL_VERSION): Method 'resources/subscribe' is not supported by the negotiated protocol version (wire era 2026-07-28)

✔ 10 steps (2 expected/unexpected errors) — saved outputs/examples/c3-subscriptions.json
